{"id":"alles","lemma":"alles","pos":"pron","rank":51,"glosses":["everything; all","all (as in \"we all\" etc.)","Used with an interrogative to express that the answer probably covers more than one item, like dialectal English all."],"ipa":"/ˈaləs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f0/De-alles.ogg/De-alles.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Hast du alles?","en":"Do you have everything?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593148","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Habt ihr alles?","en":"Do you have everything?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755458","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},null]},{"text":"Haben Sie alles?","en":"Do you have everything?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755459","words":[{"g":"have"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null]},{"text":"Alles ist schlecht.","en":"Everything is bad.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390082","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"bad"}]},{"text":"Alles war verloren.","en":"Everything was lost.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/87209","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"lost, missing"}]}]}